WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.350
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.350
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.820
I can't believe you'll be on "Dance! Maguro Palace!!"

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.990
You're amazing, Ichigo-tan!

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.820
I'm only a stand-in though.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:20.950
Nevertheless, it's incredible that they called you in to be on such a popular show.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:24.040
When you put it like that, I can't help but get nervous.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.080
Then I'll lend this to you.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.890
It's a charm.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.460
Thanks, Otome-chan.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.340
Isn't it about time that you left?

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.790
But I'm not done cleaning yet...

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.340
I'll finish it up for you.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.350
Make all you can of this chance! {ugh, stop using English strangely} {It's not just that, this sentence is just odd}

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.430
I will!

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.140
I see. So Hoshimiya was called specifically.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.930
Right. The effects since then are unmistakable.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:49.660
Her concert with Kanzaki Mizuki really did cause a big change.

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:53.420
True, and it's all due to Hoshimiya's efforts.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.120
But her true abilities will only 
be tested from this point forward.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.490
If it's Starmiya then there'll be no problems.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:02.620
Let's keep a close eye on her development.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.250
It's so late already. I wonder if Aoi's asleep?

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:13.310
My body throbs on such moonlit nights...

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:17.260
My body yearns for blood!

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:26.440
Found you...

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:30.820
Um...

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:37.080
Consider it an honor to have your blood sucked by Yurika-sama.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.820
N-No way...

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:53.000
Was that a part of a rehearsal... or something?

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.390
Hi, signalize!

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:16.670
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:16.670
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.560
No, that's wrong

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.560
iie chigau yo

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:23.940
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:23.940
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:25.730
Do that signalize!

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:30.910
Something's starting to bubble up

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:30.910
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.870
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.870
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.410
So I'll believe in the present

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.410
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:43.580
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:43.580
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.920
Chance for me

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:50.220
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:50.220
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:54.430
It's just another challenge on the way

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:54.430
hora chousen matteru yo

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:59.350
Where are we headed?

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:59.350
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:03.100
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:03.100
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:10.360
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:10.360
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:13.740
Where we're headed

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:13.740
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.620
is into our hopes for the future

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.620
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:24.960
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:24.960
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:34.310
How was your gig at "Dance! Maguro Palace!!"?

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.820
Variety...

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:40.500
Now that's an unexpected weakness. 
Did you mess up somewhere?

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.320
They told her to play a little sister character.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:47.330
So you're the girl who's like a little Mizuki-chan.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:52.080
Yes, I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo. Maguro-san, thank you for inviting me to your show.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.580
Alright, I got it! Try to act like a little sister character today.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.460
Sister?

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.620
Your catchphrase'll be "Onii-chan, you idiot!"

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:00.940
Try it out.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.930
I don't think I can do that...

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.600
Don't be shy now.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.850
He said he wasn't feeling it after I tried to say it.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.830
I think I can see why. Try saying it again to us.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.100
Right now?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.480
We'll check it out for you. Go on.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.980
Onii-chan, you idiot!

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.360
Is that really how you did it?

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.190
You're not understanding her character.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:22.660
Character?

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:26.850
Loving your older brother and getting jealous of any girl who makes a pass at him

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.490
are the basics of a little sister character.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.980
Really? I don't get it.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:34.710
I love Ichigo-tan the most when she's being herself.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.210
Thanks. Oh, right.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.910
Thanks for this.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:40.710
Sure.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.220
That reminds me...

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.870
Just what was that?

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.520
It's the last bell!

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.850
Good morning, honeys!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:58.980
Once again, today is Galaxy! Amazing! It's showtime!

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.980
I've come with a rock'n roll audition today.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:07.370
Your beloved cool brand, Loli Gothic, will be sponsoring the Rock Festival.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.990
If you pass the audition you'll appear in the Rock Festival, yeah!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.720
Rock Festival! I've always wanted to be in one.

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.840
This seems fun! Let's do it, Aoi.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.000
I knew you'd say that.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.570
Listen, honeys.

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:23.070
There will be a lot of applicants to this audition, but among them all the girl who stands out to win

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.260
is the vampire, Toudou Yurika.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.190
Aw, it's Yurika-sama.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.260
Guess I'll give it up.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.070
Who's Yurika-sama?

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:33.930
Born of a man and a vampire, said to be 600 years old.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:38.170
She's searching for a servant who can stand the unrelenting flow of time beside her.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:41.770
That's her background. She calls 
herself the descendant of vampires,

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:45.290
and got her big break because of her mysterious character.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.530
A descendant of vampires...

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:52.580
Aye! She's in my class, right over there.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.460
From yesterday!

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.160
What, you know her?

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.830
No, I just happened to see her 
walking outside the dorms last night.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.670
She was prowling around looking for prey.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.930
It's a parasol! Is she avoiding sunburn?

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.770
It's to fit her image of being a vampire.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.180
Do you know what vampires are weak against?

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.850
Garlic... and sunlight!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.270
Plus things made out of silver.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.940
Oh, that would explain it!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.480
N-No!

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.160
Is Yurika-chan on a diet?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.970
She always only drinks rose tea.

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:42.680
Vampires don't eat. They drink rose or 
red wine, or sometimes tomato juice instead. {Kobato likes tomato juice, right?}{yep}

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:44.130
She's pretty thorough.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:50.850
The beauty of vampires is to lure in unsuspecting victims.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.640
So mysterious.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.630
Yurika-chan's actually pretty popular.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:02.060
I'm gonna go say hi to her.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:03.400
Go for it!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.430
Yurika-chan! I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.400
We met last night by the dorms...

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:14.830
I'm taking the Loli Gothic audition 
too. Let's both do our best.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.730
Don't touch me so carelessly.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:22.390
I'm a descendant of vampires who shares blood with the great Count Dracula.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:25.630
Back in my day, such a rude girl 
would have already been beheaded.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.920
B-Beheaded?!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:31.300
Or perhaps... you really <i>do</i> wish to 
have Yurika-sama suck your blood?

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.800
There it is! Yurika-sama's catchphrase!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.860
I'm losing my energy...

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:42.640
I must return to my coffin to restore my vampire powers!

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:47.440
Amazing! Yurika-chan really is amazing 
to get that into her character!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.560
Her personality and background of being a descendant of vampires go super well together.

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:55.590
It may be hard to tell exactly how much of it is acting,

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:58.690
but what we know for sure is that Loli Gothic suits her perfectly.

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:02.360
Plus, her ability to get into her role so well isn't something everyone can do.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:03.710
It's a powerful weapon.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:04.650
Weapon?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:10.950
Yeah. Just like being good at singing or dancing, having a strong character is another type of weapon for idols.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:15.260
In other words, you'll need to have an even stronger character than Yurika-chan to beat her.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.220
A character, huh...

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.720
You don't have much of a chance at winning as you are now.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:23.530
I see... then let's try making a character!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.650
A pirate girl.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.490
A werewolf.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.990
Ichigo-tan from planet Strawberry.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.340
Love you!!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:41.000
Absolutely not.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.370
This is harder than I expected.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.720
Rome wasn't built in a day.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.990
You can't make a character in a day.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.510
You can do it!

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:53.380
But I can't think of anything else.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:57.050
Normally you'd want to think of something using Loli Gothic clothes as an inspiration.

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.390
But then Johnny-sensei said...

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.890
There's no need to get caught up in Loli Gothic clothes!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.390
So I'm not sure what to do.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.150
I still think it would be best to stick with Loli Gothic though.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.900
But I don't have any of those!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.430
Leave it to me!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.780
This is the Striped Trenchcoat with Lace-up Loli Boots.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.570
It looks surprisingly good on you.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:17.750
Yeah, it's not bad.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.660
I love the Loli Gothic Ichigo-tan too!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.450
Really? Does it inspire any character ideas?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.420
Hey!

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:32.810
It really <i>is</i> hard to think up a character...

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.860
Hoshimiya.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.530
Oh, Mizuki-san!

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:38.680
I heard from the Headmistress.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.970
You're taking the Rock Festival audition?

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.170
I am.

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:43.400
Who's your opponent?

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:45.110
It's Toudou Yurika-chan.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:45.850
I see.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:50.230
It's as if she's a totally different person from when she first entered this school.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:56.050
I'm truly impressed... she really put in a lot of effort.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.140
Well then, good luck.

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:01.530
Good night.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:04.870
A different person... what does she mean?

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.420
Like a different person?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.430
Mizuki-san said that?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:19.170
Yeah.

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:20.820
That's a bit unexpected. {this happened before, I don't know what to do with it}

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:24.280
Otome-chan, do you remember how Yurika-chan was when she first came here?

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:26.020
Not at all.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.690
I wonder what kind of girl Yurika-chan used to be.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:40.520
Yurika-chan, are you listening to the 
song we're doing for the audition?

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.160
I <i>thought</i> I told you not to carelessly call out to me? {except you didn't}

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.330
Do you want Yurika-sama to suck your blood?

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.040
What're you listening to?

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.290
Ah! It's "Move on now!"

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.320
That's Mizuki-chan's song!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.720
So she likes Mizuki-chan too!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.470
So Yurika's a fan of Mizuki-san too, huh.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.670
I feel a bit closer to her now.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.690
You won't be able to beat her like that.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.310
How's this?

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:18.320
The bride of Frankenstein.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.610
What's your catchphrase?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.630
I want to be human!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.230
Ichigo-tan's scary.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:24.490
It's kind of new!

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:28.580
The descendant of vampires versus 
the bride of Frankenstein, huh.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.580
I'm going to use this for the audition!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.230
What are you doing?

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.880
I'm engraving the lyrics onto my soul.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:44.140
Weren't you the one who taught me to do that?

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:47.140
I'm asking about that <i>outfit</i>.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:51.670
I'm the bride of Frankenstein. I want to be hum—

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.020
You planning to wear that for the audition?

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.150
Does it have more of an impact than Yurika-chan?

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:02.680
Well, if you're enjoying it from the bottom of your heart, your fans might enjoy themselves too.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:12.210
What did he mean?

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:16.490
Ichigo!

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:18.170
Aoi! Heading back now?

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.220
Yeah!

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.800
How was the meeting for "Naughty Detectives"?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.950
Perfect!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:24.990
This smell...

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:25.760
Garlic?

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:29.310
Isn't that... Yurika-chan?

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.970
What's she holding?

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:33.310
It's hard to see, but... a bowl?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.180
Ah! It's garlic ramen from Rairaiken!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.570
You're too loud!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:45.510
I get it now. I was wondering when she ate— I guess she always gets it delivered.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:49.980
And it's <i>garlic</i> ramen! Vampires 
are supposed to be weak to garlic.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.080
Things have gotten more interesting.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.580
I can't even imagine it.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.070
Hard to believe that Yurika likes garlic ramen.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.300
Yeah! Now I want to know even more about her.

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:03.590
Only three days until the audition.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.940
I'm going for a quick run.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:06.090
Huh, now?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.590
I'm just a bit excited.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:14.310
<i>I've got my character decided, and 
I engraved the lyrics onto my soul.</i>

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.100
<i>Alright, I can do this!</i>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.110
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.120
What's that?!

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:33.960
Help!

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.650
Yurika-chan, are you okay?

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:38.010
My umbrella... my umbrella's inside!

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.310
I can't be a vampire without that!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:42.570
Umbrella? Oh, your parasol?

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.250
Wait here.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.760
Parasol... parasol...

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:51.140
There it is!

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:54.530
Stupid, what are you doing?!

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:58.730
Here.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.270
Why...

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.230
It's an important prop, isn't it?

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.990
Th-Thank you.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:10.190
The fire's out. Are you two hurt?

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:11.780
We're fine.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:17.500
I'm sorry. I was straightening my 
candles when they suddenly fell over.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:18.890
Candles?

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:21.040
Were you burning incense or something?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.840
No, I was uploading pictures of a vampire ritual to my blog.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.260
So that was why.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:30.050
It's fine to make a character, but you 
should be careful when using fire.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.960
I understand. I'm really sorry.

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:34.700
The same to you all.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.270
Huh?

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.810
Thank you very much.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.060
Yurika-chan, what's wrong? {Come on, Ichigo}

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:44.070
Wh-What are you acting so friendly for?

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:48.460
I'm a descendant of vampires who shares blood with the great Count Dracula!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:50.320
What do you think you're doing...

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.830
Her character's falling apart.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.380
So Yurika-chan really <i>does</i> have a cute side to her. {cute's better}

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:08.220
Wow! It really feels like a vampire's room.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.590
This really is GothLoli. {written like this according to wiki}

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.590
GothLoli?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.450
Fully known as Gothic Lolita.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:18.700
It's a fashion style that allows girls to express their dreams and the hidden darkness that lies within them.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.270
Loli Gothic is a brand of Aikatsu 
cards which embodies that principle.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.480
Please have some tea.

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:31.740
I can't thank you enough for saving me back there.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.290
Gap Love! {dammit, Otome. might need a note on gap moe} {hahahaha}

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.740
She really is like a different person.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.990
Yeah.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:40.010
Her character might be different, but you really do love things like this, right?

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:42.000
These teacups really suit you.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:46.550
Well you know, I was immediately taken by these teacups when I saw them in an antique shop.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:51.650
I hesitated a bit because they were expensive, but they looked exactly like the teacups from "The Vampire's Lover",

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.010
and I couldn't help myself.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.300
"The Vampire's Lover"?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.060
It's from an old manga.

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:05.750
Though vampires must never love 
humans, she fell in love with a man.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.070
It's a story about how her love can never be fulfilled.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.650
I was struck by how sorrowful it was,

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.530
and started to like vampires more and more.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.680
I'm sorry! I just went off on a tangent all by myself.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:23.080
Don't worry, you looked like you were 
having a lot of fun just now.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.180
You must really love them.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:28.130
I think you'd be fine auditioning as you are now though.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.090
There's no way I could win as myself.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:31.590
Yurika-chan?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:38.480
Ever since I was little, I loved old European dolls and frilly clothes.

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:41.320
I spent a lot of time playing in my own world,

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:46.020
but when I entered Starlight Academy, I saw how brightly everyone was shining.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.320
I thought that I had nothing in comparison.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.830
And that's when you found out about Loli Gothic clothes?

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:56.140
I thought that I could be myself if I wore those clothes.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:59.990
That's how your vampire character was born, right?

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.200
Yes.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.500
But I think it's really amazing that you can express yourself through your vampire character. {I think there's a more eloquent way to express tsuranukitoosu}

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.010
It's because it makes my fans happy.

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.000
Huh?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:16.430
It was my fans who first said that this character was interesting and decided to support me.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:19.510
That's why every day I think of more ways to entertain my fans.

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.770
It's so much fun that I just can't help myself!

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:30.290
Yurika-chan really holds her fans close to her heart.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.020
Yeah.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:39.030
And finally, the day of the audition came.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.030
Let's both do our best.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.540
If you don't, Yurika-sama will feast upon your blood.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.540
Yeah. I'm gonna act like myself too.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.130
That Ichigo sure knows how to do things.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.080
Oh?

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:29.640
Nicely done. It's just like Hoshimiya 
to come out wearing her own brand.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.220
Ichigo-tan shines the brightest as herself!

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:33.650
You can do it, Ichigo!

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:30.950
Awesome!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:34.810
You rock, Yurika-sama!

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:38.810
And the one who will star in the Rock Festival is...

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:41.570
Toudou!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.350
So she couldn't beat Yurika.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:50.890
Though Toudou was chosen this time due to how well she matches the brand's image,

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:52.700
Starmiya was also given praise.

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:58.460
The higher-ups from Loli Gothic gave you a good assessment based on how you expanded the possibilities of the brand.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:03.010
Really? I wonder if it's because I was able to convey how much fun I was having.

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:05.170
That may be so. At least it's a good way to lose.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.440
Yeah, I think so too.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:10.470
To tread upon a vampire's shadow...

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:13.180
do you want Yurika-sama to suck your blood that badly?

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.390
She really is great at what she does.

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:18.730
Love You!

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:20.260
The normal Yurika-chan...

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:22.390
is a secret between us!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.990 --> 00:24:01.200
I wonder what sort of character would suit me?

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:05.240
Let's see... Ugh, sunlight! I must return to my coffin!

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:06.670
She slipped away!

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:09.870
A character can't be made in a day.

00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:12.630
Oh no, look at this article!

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:14.910
An article about Yurika-chan? But this—!

00:24:14.910 --> 00:24:17.320
Oh my god! It's a scandal!

00:24:17.320 --> 00:24:19.080
S-Scandal?!

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:20.610
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.610 --> 00:24:21.810
Vampire Scandal.

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:24.210
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
